<section class="band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">The compliance pathway</div>
      <h2>What actually has to happen between feasibility and energisation.</h2>
      <p>Most delays in renewable interconnection trace back to one of these four gates being treated as paperwork instead of engineering. We treat them as engineering.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pipeline">
      <div class="pipeline-thread"></div>

      <div class="stage">
        <div class="stage-node"></div>
        <div class="stage-text">
          <span class="stage-tag">STAGE 01 · STUDY</span>
          <h3>Feasibility &amp; load flow</h3>
          <p>We build the plant's PSS®E model against the actual interconnection point, run load flow and short-circuit cases, and flag thermal or voltage violations before they reach a review committee.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stage-visual">
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="row"><span>MODEL</span><span>PSS®E v35</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>CASE TYPE</span><span>Load flow / SC</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>OUTPUT</span><span>Voltage &amp; thermal map</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage">
        <div class="stage-node"></div>
        <div class="stage-text">
          <span class="stage-tag">STAGE 02 · TRANSIENT</span>
          <h3>Dynamic &amp; EMT verification</h3>
          <p>PSCAD models validate fault ride-through, inverter control response, and protection settings under transient conditions — the cases SLDC reviewers ask about when the load flow alone isn't convincing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stage-visual">
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="row"><span>MODEL</span><span>PSCAD/EMTDC</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>CASE TYPE</span><span>FRT / transient stability</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>OUTPUT</span><span>Relay coordination table</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage">
        <div class="stage-node"></div>
        <div class="stage-text">
          <span class="stage-tag">STAGE 03 · APPROVAL</span>
          <h3>CEA &amp; SLDC submission</h3>
          <p>Technical feasibility reports and interconnection study packages, formatted and argued the way your specific SLDC reviews them — drawing on 18+ prior approvals across regions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stage-visual">
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="row"><span>SUBMISSION</span><span>TFR + study package</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>AUTHORITY</span><span>CEA / SLDC</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>STATUS</span><span style="color:#1C7C54">Approved</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage">
        <div class="stage-node"></div>
        <div class="stage-text">
          <span class="stage-tag">STAGE 04 · COMMISSIONING</span>
          <h3>Real-time control &amp; energisation</h3>
          <p>On-site support for SCADA, AGC, and AVR set-point commissioning, especially for hybrid plants where storage dispatch logic has to satisfy grid code in real operating conditions, not just simulation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stage-visual">
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="row"><span>SYSTEMS</span><span>SCADA / AGC / AVR</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>SCOPE</span><span>Solar + storage hybrid</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>OUTCOME</span><span>Energised &amp; compliant</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
